  "“WIN!” 标记只表示该项历史指标按指定方向较优；同值不作标记。它不表示基金整体评级，历史结果不代表未来概率。": "WIN! marks the better historical value in the specified direction for one metric. Ties are unmarked. It is not an overall rating, and historical frequencies are not future probabilities.",
