  "%，或最近5个实际净值间隔变化达到": "%, or a move over the last five observed NAV intervals of at least ",
  "%。旧缓存、明显滞后和未复权序列不触发异动预警；阈值可以在设置中修改。它是历史净值异动，不能充当盘中交易信号。": "%. Stale caches, materially delayed series and unadjusted data do not trigger alerts. Change thresholds in Settings. These describe historical NAV changes, not intraday signals.",
  "显示板最多监控收藏中的前30只基金。": "The dashboard monitors at most the first 30 favorites.",
  "当前定投方案是网站中的模拟设置，不表示已实际交易。结算日": "The displayed DCA plan is a simulation, not an executed trade. Valuation date ",
  "部分基金披露滞后或缓存过期，请核对所属日期。": "Some funds have delayed disclosures or stale caches. Check their valuation dates.",
  "网页内显示板可在页面打开时更新。后台系统推送当前未启用；AI总结需要自己的API，费用由服务商计费。": "This dashboard updates while the page is open. System push is disabled. AI summaries require your API key; your provider may charge for calls.",
