  "清理本机行情缓存与行情总结，保留个人资料、陪伴天数、收藏、历史、Agent配置及对话。": "Clear local market caches and summaries while keeping your profile, companion days, favorites, history, Agent configuration and conversations.",
  "已清理": "Removed ",
  "项行情缓存": " market cache entries",
  "浏览器未允许清理缓存。": "This browser did not allow cache cleanup.",
  "网页内预警与行情显示板已可用。云端后台推送按要求暂缓，因此关闭网页后不会发送通知。": "In-page alerts and the market dashboard are available. Cloud push is paused, so no notifications are sent after you close the page.",
  "iPhone后台通知需要iOS 16.4或更新版本、添加到主屏幕、用户点击授权以及可用的Web Push发送服务；目前不显示已开通状态。": "iPhone background notifications require iOS 16.4 or later, installation on the Home Screen, a user permission action and a working Web Push sender. This feature is currently disabled.",
  "每日AI总结需先配置并测试API；启用后仅在个人页打开时生成，每个净值快照最多自动尝试一次。服务商可能收取模型调用费用。基金名称、来源资料和对话内容保留原文。": "Configure and test your API before enabling daily AI summaries. They run only while Personal is open, with at most one automatic attempt per NAV snapshot. Your provider may charge for calls. Fund names, source records and existing conversations keep their original text.",
  "部分净值读取失败，总值暂不可用，请刷新重试。": "Some NAVs could not be loaded. Total value is unavailable; refresh to retry.",
  "研究不同类型的人民币公募基金，说明依据，在预算内建立分散的模拟持仓。": "Research different types of CNY public funds, explain the evidence, and build a diversified paper portfolio within the budget.",
